			<billMsgList>
				<billMsg>JAN1</billMsg>
				<msgOnBill>Happy New Year! We hope everyone had a great holiday season with their loved ones. This is a friendly reminder that we have recently launched our new customer portal. If you have not already, please sign up by visiting https://mywateraccount.newarknj.gov</msgOnBill>
			</billMsgList>
			<billMsgList>
				<billMsg>JAN2</billMsg>
				<msgOnBill>/user/login to enjoy our improved services. If you experience any difficulties, send us an email at watersewer.customerservice@ci.newark.nj.us and include your phone number to update our records. Please note that during the winter months</msgOnBill>
			</billMsgList>
			<billMsgList>
				<billMsg>JAN3</billMsg>
				<msgOnBill>we will not be shutting off water. However, this does not mean you should neglect your outstanding balances. We urge you to make timely payments against any current and past due balances. If you do not have a payment plan,</msgOnBill>
			</billMsgList>
			<billMsgList>
				<billMsg>JAN4</billMsg>
				<msgOnBill>ensure you keep up with the agreement. If you do not have a payment plan, please contact us at 973-733-6370 as soon as possible prior to the end of the winter season. Thank you.</msgOnBill>
			</billMsgList>
